ope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]}],"link":"85517","synopsis":"Thanks to the mysterious penfriend Mr. Poppit Rino Rando is attending Miyagami School, accompanied by her sarcastic puppet Pucchan. She finds out the apartment organised for her has burnt down, so she heads up to the school. She ends up sleeping outside after she gets frightened by a bear in the bushes and another student, Kaori Izumi, who turns out to be her class president. Rino ends up trying for a position on the Student Council so she can get somewhere to live (they're given an apartment building to live in), and by a series of accidents on the way to the Student Council building manages to defeat the arsonist who burnt down her apartment, thus ending up on the best student council!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/83536/episodes/5f570194e6e0d.jpg"},{"title":"Surging With Youth","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2964","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"456","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"456","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"28934","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"83536","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"85518","synopsis":"The council throws a welcoming party for Rino (What about the budget?!) as the school is jealous over Rino being put on the Best Student Council on her first day.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/83536/episodes/5f5701a5ca2f9.jpg"},{"title":"Payapaya in the Gokujou Dorms","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2964","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"456","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"456","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"28934","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"83536","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"85519","synopsis":"Rino is on the Best Student Council, which comes as a shock to nearly the whole school and many of the students can't understand why Rino made it onto the Best Student Council. She's not the brightest, failing her tests miserably, or good at sports. Not to mention the fact that she's clumsy. So what does she bring to the group? Why did the President of the Best Student Council pick her? Because of this, rumors start to fly about Rino and the President. Those opposed to the President's decision are upset and in disbelief. The Paparazzi Club, the Photography Club, and the Newspaper Club all team up to find out just what's going on.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/83536/episodes/5f5701b6b3836.jpg"},{"title":"A Brilliantly Clear-Headed Way","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2964","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"456","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"456","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"28934","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"83536","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"85520","synopsis":"The puppet theater is sabotaged; Rino and Pucchan investigate.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/83536/episodes/5f5701ccaa901.jpg"},{"title":"Spectacular Showdown","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2964","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"456","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"456","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"28934","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"83536","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"85521","synopsis":"The budget is ove